# Rack Row 7: Spine league, track 2. Tight and technical: four rows of
# racks driven as switchbacks with three hairpins, kinks in rows 1 and 3,
# two throttled rows, rails everywhere. Driven from the top-left: east
# along row 1, hairpin down to row 2 west, hairpin to row 3 east, hairpin
# to row 4 west, a dip into the bottom-left pocket, then all the way back
# up the west wall to the line. Control point 0 is the start line;
# features on point i apply to the segment from point i to i+1.
league spine
width 48
# x    y    half   features
 320  120   46                     # start line, row 1 east
 520  120   46
 600  150   46                     # a kink in row 1
 680  120   46
 780  120   46
 870  160   46                     # hairpin 1
 890  230   46
 860  300   46
 770  320   46     throttled       # row 2 west, throttled
 400  320   46
 310  350   46                     # hairpin 2
 290  420   46
 310  490   46
 400  520   46
 520  520   46                     # row 3 east, a kink
 600  550   46
 680  520   46
 780  520   46
 870  560   46                     # hairpin 3
 890  630   46
 860  700   46
 770  720   46     throttled       # row 4 west, throttled
 360  720   46
 320  740   46                     # down into the bottom pocket
 300  830   46
 230  895   46
 150  860   46
 130  760   46                     # back up the west wall
 140  560   46
 130  300   46
 190  150   46
